WEBVTT

00:20:25.637 --> 00:20:31.559
So I think it's a place of bridging
the different wisdoms

00:20:31.559 --> 00:20:34.896
of the older generation
and the younger generation

00:20:34.896 --> 00:20:37.315
to come up with that one conversation.

00:20:37.357 --> 00:20:38.650
Because, you know,

00:20:38.692 --> 00:20:42.904
the fight is not just
for the younger generation.

00:20:42.946 --> 00:20:44.781
The fight is for everyone.

00:20:44.781 --> 00:20:48.743
MR: So Vanessa, how do you see
the increasing climate shocks basically,

00:20:48.785 --> 00:20:53.957
and impacts impacting on the rights
of people in African countries?

00:20:54.541 --> 00:20:58.628
VN: I will first of all mention
something I remember in school

00:20:58.670 --> 00:21:00.714
that was taught about rights.